      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know. i feel like i've just tried so many things to get better but nothing works. like im just fundamentally broken somehow. its like there is this part of me that is just permanently damaged and no amount of therapy or \"healing\" is ever gonna fix it. im just so tired of trying to fix something that isnt fixable.",
